Package: ivmsm
Title: Instrumental Variable Bounds under the Marginal Sensitivity Model
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Antonio", "Olivas-Martinez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "antonio.olivas@gmail.com")
Description: Potential-outcome mean and treatment-effect bounds under marginal
    sensitivity models with instrumental variables. Includes binary and ordered
    outcomes, continuous-outcome restricted-class estimators, general finite
    instrument probability interfaces, and outward confidence band calibration.
    Statistical inference requires the regularity conditions in the accompanying
    paper <https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22513>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: stats, utils, splines, graphics
Suggests: nnet, mgcv, ranger, glmnet, xgboost, SuperLearner, hal9001, nloptr
Collate: 'sharp_bounds_plugin.R' 'binary_outcome_bounds.R'
    'binary_rkhs_gamma_nuisances.R' 'discrete_outcome_bounds.R'
    'binary_continuum_band.R' 'binary_grid_band.R' 'finite_iv.R'
    'finite_iv_continuous.R' 'finite_iv_binary.R' 'presentation.R' 'zzz.R'
